Z||000000||FieroWife||08-13-2001||02:58 PM||||The last two years, 87ECO5 (Scott) and I have done a calendar for the forum.  I'm wondering if there is still a need/want for it this year.  I'm willing to take this on again.  I'd like to start collecting pictures very soon so we can have these ready by mid-November or sooner.  Let me know what all of you think.  I was also thinking, I'd be happy to group pics by friends, states whatever.  All that is needed from forum members is to email me a high-end jpeg file (or mail me the photo, I'll scan for you), year of the vehicle, name of person that owns the car and who's car you like to see yours with.  Last year we did forum handles under the cars, we can do that, real names or both.<P>Let me know... Thanks! ~Lisa<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/fierowife/Signature.gif"> ||||reg||1
