Z||000024||FieroWife||08-14-2001||03:57 PM||||I did want to clear up some confusion that we had last year.  If you send me a photo, it will make the calendar.  Everyone that sends one will have at least one included.  Some of you sent me several last year and I was able to fit most of them in.  I think this year we have the potential for a lot more cars, so if you send me more than one, make sure you let me know which one you definitely want used and I'll add seconds and thirds as space allows.<P>Also, I could use some cover ideas.  I liked the one I did last year but I could use some new ideas.  Cliff, if you would like to design the cover, I'll use it.<P>Photos can be emailed to me anytime at FieroWife@aol.com.  Please remember to include your first name and forum handle.  If you need me to scan for you, email me and I'll send you our address.  Thanks!!!||||reg||1
